  "note": "The icon an icon card shows (FeatureGridBlock.astro variant icons, lib/slot-visuals.mjs): the first rule whose words appear in the card's title, else in its text, else the fallback (null: no icon). A word matches a whole word of the card (hyphened words and two-word phrases joined by a hyphen too), its plural too, whatever its case; a word written with capitals (IT, HR, PR) matches only so written; a word ending in * matches every word it starts (account* matches accounting, accountant). Rules are tried in order, so the more specific come first. The icons are Lucide's (src/lib/lucide-icons.json, ISC licence): a name here that the set does not hold fails the tests. Written for any trade: a site that needs another icon adds its rule here, with the icon copied into the set from the same Lucide release.",
